{"id":"448628","name":"鲅鱼丸子汤","author":"hb俗人","authorId":"10224823","desc":"","cover":"images/448628/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鲅鱼","amount":"一条"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲅鱼一条去头去内脏。","img":"images/448628/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鲅鱼刺去掉，剩下鱼肉，用刀剁成泥。","img":"images/448628/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱切碎。","img":"images/448628/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜切碎。","img":"images/448628/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香菜洗净切小段。","img":"images/448628/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把剁好的鱼泥，葱姜淀粉香油，适量盐，放入盆中。","img":"images/448628/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把鱼泥搅拌均匀。","img":"images/448628/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中放入适量清水，烧至冒泡泡，把鱼泥从虎口挤出，用勺子舀到锅中。","img":"images/448628/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鱼丸全部做好，大火烧开。","img":"images/448628/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鱼丸全部飘起，放入香菜关火。","img":"images/448628/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/448628/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}